The templates under corpus/
---------------------------

The test bench stores the source of third-party templates so that a
change can be held against what those projects actually write. Those
templates are not part of the library and are not covered by the
license above. Each one stays under the license of the project it came
from; corpus/skin-sources.json names the project, the licence and the
commit for every one of them.
